    <string name="help_q_offline">Does AGAPE work offline?</string>
    <string name="help_a_offline">Yes. The Bible, prayers, plans, quizzes and Church section are in the app. Only the saint and readings of the day need a connection, and the last ones are kept.</string>
    <string name="help_q_translation">Which Bible translation is used?</string>
    <string name="help_a_translation">English uses the World English Bible; Dutch uses the Statenvertaling with Apocrypha. Both are in the public domain and include the deuterocanonical books.</string>
    <string name="help_q_quiz">Why do some plans have quizzes?</string>
    <string name="help_a_quiz">Plans marked “with quizzes” open the next day once you pass a short quiz. It helps you read attentively, not quickly.</string>
    <string name="help_q_notifications">I do not receive prayer reminders</string>
    <string name="help_a_notifications">Check that reminders are on in Me → Settings and that AGAPE may send notifications in your phone settings. Some phones stop reminders to save battery.</string>
    <string name="help_q_church">Can I change my Church?</string>
    <string name="help_a_church">Yes, in Me → Settings. The books, prayers, councils and plans will follow your new choice.</string>

